    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/d55acee1c0a1a6651b740a451389c247.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll &amp; Spin. That's it. That's the basis for maneuvering the Wheelbot through each level. It all gets much more difficult when the game introduces rails, bombs, acid pools and hard to reach places.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/8633928be8fc4ed944787459bd04629f.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grind a blue rail, you must land onto the rail with your blue wheel. The orange wheel will simply pass through the blue rail as if it wasn't there. Vice versa with the orange rails and blue wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/cfebcbd0ee86459ba1088790f32adc8b.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangers such as pools of acid, bombs, and spikes on your way to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/d2fce98666e168e72f85c828da002146.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is clear. Reach the exit!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/d55acee1c0a1a6651b740a451389c247.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/eb6d1b759977be95aaa83639be5c2e46.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll &amp; Spin. That's it. That's the basis for maneuvering the Wheelbot through each level. It all gets much more difficult when the game introduces rails, bombs, acid pools and hard to reach places.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/8633928be8fc4ed944787459bd04629f.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/b5763491dd3e2210155e249f9966156a.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grind a blue rail, you must land onto the rail with your blue wheel. The orange wheel will simply pass through the blue rail as if it wasn't there. Vice versa with the orange rails and blue wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/cfebcbd0ee86459ba1088790f32adc8b.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/22e4711f8c83111288084cf55ffc015e.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangers such as pools of acid, bombs, and spikes on your way to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/d2fce98666e168e72f85c828da002146.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.poster.avif?t=1745869962\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.webm?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385170/extras/aa1388abc30228982f8426f741195fd1.mp4?t=1745869962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is clear. Reach the exit!</p>",
